<title>HONG KONG: CNPC HK jumps 12 pct to new year high.</title>
<headline>CNPC HK jumps 12 pct to new year high.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of oil explorer CNPC (Hong Kong) Ltd ended HK$0.05 or 12.05 percent up at HK$0.465 after they hit a new year high of HK$0.47 in late trade.</p>
<p>Brokers said speculation of a possible enlargement of the company's net asset value in the wake of market rumours that it was planning to buy oilfields in Southeast Asia boosted late speculative buying.</p>
<p>Volume was 239.63 million shares worth HK$107.45 million.</p>
<p>The company officials were available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
